opencode.local.json
/.agents.backup-before-integration-cleanup/
/.specify.backup-before-integration-cleanup/

# Local agent tooling state. Per-checkout caches and generated indexes, not project
# source. Narrow rules only, deliberately:
#   .opencode/commands/ is TRACKED project configuration and stays tracked; so does
#     this file. .opencode/node_modules, package.json and package-lock.json are
#     already covered by .opencode/.gitignore and are not duplicated here.
#   .opencode/index/ is generated index state from a local tool.
#   .codebase-memory/ is a retired tool's generated call-graph artifact. The tool is
#     uninstalled, the tracked artifact was deleted, and it must never be reintroduced.
#   .serena/ holds only local caches, generated memories and per-checkout config —
#     nothing under it is tracked. Its own .gitignore already covers cache/ and
#     project.local.yml; the whole directory is ignored here so a checkout stays clean.
#   .cbmignore belongs beside the index it configures.
# Shared tool guidance lives in AGENTS.md, which stays tracked.
/.codebase-memory/
/.opencode/index/
/.opencode/codebase-index.json
/.specify/integrations/.cache/
/.serena/
/.cbmignore

# Build
*.log
*.tmp
js/*.map
css/*.map
